---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base>
  <section class="page">
    <h1>Formation</h1>
    <p class="quote">“As therefore you received Christ Jesus the Lord, so live in him, rooted and built up in him and established in the faith...”</p>
    <p class="subtitle">Colossians 2:6–7</p>

    <h2>Faith Formation at Christ the King</h2>
    <p>Faith formation is a lifelong journey of growing closer to Jesus Christ and deepening our understanding of the Catholic faith. Through Scripture, prayer, learning, and fellowship with our parish community, we grow as disciples of Christ and learn to live out the Gospel in our daily lives.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Children's faith formation introduces elementary-age children to the teachings of Jesus, Sacred Scripture, prayer, and the traditions of the Catholic Church. Sessions are held on Sundays. Times are on the registration form.</p>
    <p>Preparation for First Reconciliation and First Eucharist is on the <a href="/sacraments">Sacraments page</a>.</p>
    <p>Contact Leslie Soell, (719) 542-9248 ext. 113, lsoell@ctkpueblo.org.</p>

    <h2>Middle and high school</h2>
    <p>Youth faith formation helps middle and high school students deepen their relationship with Jesus and learn to live their faith in everyday life. Confirmation preparation is for incoming 7th and 8th grade and high school youth who still need the sacrament, after one year of formation. Sessions are monthly.</p>
    <p>Contact Aden Casarez, ext. 114.</p>

    <h2>Adults</h2>
    <p>Faith formation continues throughout adulthood. Current opportunities include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Men's Bible Study, Tuesdays, 9:00–10:00 a.m.</li>
      <li>Women's Bible Study, Wednesdays, 9:00–11:00 a.m.</li>
      <li>Sunday Formation for All</li>
      <li>Fellowship Study Group, watch for the next session</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Schedules may change. Contact Sarah Nelson, ext. 121, snelson@ctkpueblo.org.</p>

    <h2>Register</h2>
    <p>Registration for Formation for All is open.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://forms.ministryforms.net/embed.aspx?formId=45ec37d1-842d-48f3-a64b-2b0b16ebd5f0">Registration form</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Parish calendar</h2>
    <p>Click an event to add it to your Google Calendar.</p>
    <div class="calendar">
      <iframe
        src="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/embed?src=christthekingpueblo%40gmail.com&amp;ctz=America/Denver"
        title="Parish calendar"
        loading="lazy"
      ></iframe>
    </div>

    <h2>Resources for Growing in Faith</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://bible.usccb.org/">Daily readings</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://formed.org/">Formed</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.usccb.org/prayers/prayers-rosary">Prayers of the Rosary</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.usccb.org/how-to-pray-the-rosary">How to Pray the Rosary</a></li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Catechism of the Catholic Church</h3>
    <p>Explore the teachings of the Catholic Church on faith, the sacraments, Christian living, and prayer.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://usccb.cld.bz/Catechism-of-the-Catholic-Church2/">Read the Catechism Online</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 12px 32px 64px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
h1 {
  text-align: center !important;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
}

.quote {
  text-align: center;
  font-style: italic !important;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
}

.subtitle {
  text-align: center;
  font-weight: bold;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
}

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
    font-family: "Source Sans 3", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  h3 {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-family: "Source Sans 3", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  p {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 1.25rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .calendar {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .calendar iframe {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 600px;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .page {
      padding: 8px 4px 40px;
    }

    .calendar iframe {
      height: 450px;
    }
  }
</style>



